# The Go example: PROJECT with a condition, a hit count, a logpoint and a configuration of
# tuitor's own, and the command line with the set commands (`:` in SOURCE, where `/` searches).
@sleep 3000
/bp toggle main.go:52
/bp toggle main.go:58
/bp toggle main.go:96
/view breakpoints
@key g g
/bp condition percent > 0
@key j
/bp hits > 3
@key j
/bp log order {order.ID}: {total}
/restart
@wait stop
/continue
@wait stop
/continue
@wait stop
/continue
@wait stop
/config add go
/view breakpoints
@key g g
@dump project.ans
/view overview
@key : s e t
@dump palette.ans
